#. Description of the plugin
#: cookie-law-consent.php
msgid ""
"Handle your Cookies and give the user the ability to Accept or not the "
"cookies."
msgstr ""
"Gérez vos cookies et donnez à l’utilisateur la possibilité d’accepter ou non "
"les cookies."

